── S1 · object + layout ──
  ✅ [C1.2b-S1.1] objects.create('รถ', parent CONTACT, titleFieldKey plate) writes ONE CustomObject in THIS CRM system — tenant/system/parentType/titleFieldKey as given, recordCount 0, not archived
  ✅ [C1.2b-S1.2] six fields of six DIFFERENT types (TEXT·NUMBER·DATE·SELECT·BOOLEAN·LOOKUP) are created for object 'car' through the engine and land as MemberField rows owned by the CRM system (systemId = crmA · objectKey = 'car') — not by the member system
  ✅ [C1.2b-S1.3] listLayout({objectKey:'car'}) returns exactly those 6 fields with their types (nothing from other objects, nothing missing)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S1.4] layouts are isolated: the member (customer) layout, the 'contract' object layout and the SAME key 'car' in another CRM system of the same tenant show none of crmA car's fields
