  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.2] NUMBER filter: range 10000..30000 (→ 2) and =5000 (→ 1)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.3] DATE filter: closed range (→ 1) and open-ended range (→ 2) on Bangkok calendar days
  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.4] SELECT filter: fuel=diesel (→ 2)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.5] LOOKUP filter: branch = unit 2 (→ 2)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.6] BOOLEAN filter (insured=true → 2) and two filters AND-ed (diesel AND mileage ≥ 20000 → 1)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S3.7] a filter on a field the object does not have is VALIDATION (never silently ignored — an ignored filter shows the whole list)

── S5 · tabsFor ──
  ✅ [C1.2b-S5.1] tabsFor(CONTACT, id) lists 'car' with count = LIVE records of THIS parent (2 — the archived third one is not counted)
  ✅ [C1.2b-S5.2] …and omits an object with showAsTab=false, an archived object and an object of another parent type (COMPANY)
